2025-01-08 16:27:37,771 - lightrag - DEBUG - get_node: query: MATCH (n:`USESTORE`) RETURN n, result: {'entity_type': '"ORGANIZATION"', 'description': '"UseStore is a module indicating the management of state in a React application, demonstrating its utility in component functionality."<SEP>"useStore is a custom hook likely used for state management within the code editor, indicating a part of the software\'s underlying architecture."<SEP>"useStore is a custom hook used for state management within the application, allowing components to access shared state."<SEP>"useStore is a state management solution that allows components to access and modify application state, indicated by its usage in managing the background visibility."<SEP>"useStore is a custom hook used for state management, accessing shared state across components."<SEP>"useStore is a state management hook that helps manage application state, particularly related to language selection and detection."<SEP>"useStore is a state management hook that provides access to a shared store within the application, enabling components to consume and update state values."<SEP>"useStore is a state management hook that enables components to access and modify global store values, specifically the dark mode in this context."<SEP>"useStore refers to a state management system that helps manage the application\'s theme state."<SEP>"useStore is a state management tool used in the ExportOptions component to manage and access the application state."<SEP>"useStore is a state management library that provides a way to manage the application\'s font size state, allowing for dynamic updates."<SEP>"useStore is a store management utility that provides state management capabilities for the application, allowing components to derive state and trigger updates."<SEP>"useStore is a state management tool utilized in the CodeEditor component to manage application state."<SEP>"useStore is a custom hook used in the code to access and manage state, particularly the \'showBackground\' variable."<SEP>"useStore is a store management system used to manage global state in the application, including font styles."<SEP>"useStore is a state management tool utilized within the DarkModeSwitch component to manage the dark mode state of the application."<SEP>"useStore is a state management tool used to manage the font size state within the application."<SEP>"useStore is likely a custom hook or a state management solution used to access and manage application state."<SEP>"useStore is a custom React hook that allows access to the application\'s state management system."<SEP>"useStore is a custom hook that may represent a state management system used within the application to manage global state."', 'source_id': 'chunk-3efea24c6e75148a91c3acd8c342b3a8<SEP>chunk-e3035f088c18d080434623dcfc5a4417<SEP>chunk-74553d634d9b4d601df908fcd48f7b07<SEP>chunk-e9bbb79427b33eb440f41c61bf89196d<SEP>chunk-0a3cab4b339647670faa754ff86a4e88<SEP>chunk-2e8119b737546a7cc2ce66a58f0a4007<SEP>chunk-d474d105d12636a7c8e5e9e7a939bfb1<SEP>chunk-724b204d391138281cad6b95aca14791<SEP>chunk-dc9b996d14ea40453a756386f5535f9b<SEP>chunk-2ff4ba3a39174838a7c46399fd682c9b<SEP>chunk-ae72ce5328a5974a22c8e570d93134f2<SEP>chunk-20917521d9563e943df6d015ad3d2ebd'}
