2025-01-08 16:29:07,768 - lightrag - DEBUG - Upserted node with label 'SELECT' and properties: {'entity_type': '"ORGANIZATION"', 'description': '"Select is a UI component that allows users to choose one or multiple options from a dropdown list, commonly used in forms and interfaces."<SEP>"Select is a UI component that provides options for users to choose from, facilitating theme selection in the application."<SEP>"Select is a UI component used to create a dropdown menu for selecting options within the LanguageSelect component."<SEP>"Select is a component that likely serves as the main dropdown selector, aggregating the selectable items into a cohesive UI element."<SEP>"Select is a component that allows users to choose an option from a dropdown menu, enhancing the user interface of the FontSelect."<SEP>"Select is a UI component used for displaying a dropdown list that allows users to choose an option from a set of predefined items."<SEP>"Select is a UI component that enables users to pick an option from a dropdown list."<SEP>"Select is a user interface component that allows users to choose options from a dropdown list, utilized within the LanguageSelect component."', 'source_id': 'chunk-a06903b6406e16bd9b6de5280edc93f2<SEP>chunk-724b204d391138281cad6b95aca14791<SEP>chunk-2ff4ba3a39174838a7c46399fd682c9b<SEP>chunk-ae72ce5328a5974a22c8e570d93134f2<SEP>chunk-9c014c1eee28ac1a70d0ee72ec7bb73a'}
2025-01-08 16:29:07,768 - lightrag - DEBUG - Upserted node with label 'THEMES' and properties: {'entity_type': '"CATEGORY"', 'description': '"Themes is a collection of options from which users can select, each represented with visual elements for better user experience."<SEP>"Themes refers to the various design themes that can be utilized within the user interface, complementing the selection of languages."<SEP>"themes denotes different visual styles available for the user interface in the application."<SEP>"themes refers to the collection of visual themes available for selection in the application, influencing the user interface\'s appearance."<SEP>"themes refers to a collection of styles that determine the visual appearance of the application, providing theme management."<SEP>"Themes refers to various styling options available in the codebase, though not explicitly mentioned in the main text."', 'source_id': 'chunk-ccb0aa39e99bd862816713ef16c5cca1<SEP>chunk-724b204d391138281cad6b95aca14791<SEP>chunk-3ffca558fb69c4e4cccf9b7e444fd604<SEP>chunk-2ff4ba3a39174838a7c46399fd682c9b'}
2025-01-08 16:29:07,769 - lightrag - DEBUG - Upserted node with label 'SELECTTRIGGER' and properties: {'entity_type': '"ORGANIZATION"', 'description': '"SelectTrigger acts as the button or element that users interact with to open the Select dropdown."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is a component that acts as the interactive element that users click on to open the dropdown and view selectable options."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is the component that activates the dropdown menu of the Select component, allowing users to open and interact with it."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is the interactive part of the Select component that users click to display the options."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is a specialized component used to initiate the dropdown selection, enabling user interaction to expand the selection menu."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is the interactive element that users click on to reveal the SelectContent in the selection component."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is the component that acts as the clickable area to reveal the SelectContent dropdown."<SEP>"SelectTrigger is the clickable area that opens the dropdown, facilitating user interaction with the Select component."', 'source_id': 'chunk-a06903b6406e16bd9b6de5280edc93f2<SEP>chunk-724b204d391138281cad6b95aca14791<SEP>chunk-2ff4ba3a39174838a7c46399fd682c9b<SEP>chunk-ae72ce5328a5974a22c8e570d93134f2<SEP>chunk-9c014c1eee28ac1a70d0ee72ec7bb73a'}
