2025-01-08 16:29:07,769 - lightrag - DEBUG - Upserted node with label 'STATE' and properties: {'entity_type': '"CONCEPT"', 'description': '"State refers to the current status of the application data managed through useStore, which determines the language preference and auto-detect settings."<SEP>"State refers to the variable that holds the dark mode setting, determining whether the application is in dark mode or light mode."<SEP>"state is a JavaScript object that contains all the parameters parsed from the URL, which are then used to update the app\'s state."<SEP>"State represents the condition or value of a component that can change over time, and it is crucial in UI frameworks for reactivity."<SEP>"state refers to the internal data structure holding the component’s state, which includes title and code information."', 'source_id': 'chunk-3efea24c6e75148a91c3acd8c342b3a8<SEP>chunk-e3035f088c18d080434623dcfc5a4417<SEP>chunk-e9bbb79427b33eb440f41c61bf89196d<SEP>chunk-2e8119b737546a7cc2ce66a58f0a4007<SEP>chunk-2ff4ba3a39174838a7c46399fd682c9b'}
